{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1w2P1DDfNigACAAMX1Z", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I stopped before signing off, because the device connection dropped and some checks are unfinished.\n\n**Bugs filed (3 reports, 1 confirmed):**\n- **Undo and Save disabled after rotation (confirmed).** In Single.md, after typing an edit, rotating to landscape and back to portrait keeps the text (\"gammaX\") but disables Undo, Redo and Save. It reproduced twice on my side, and the developer confirmed it on the second report. The first report was closed as \"could not reproduce\" and was the same bug.\n- **Favourite lost on rename (not reproduced by the developer).** Favouriting Indent2.md, renaming it to Indent3.md, and checking Go to > Favourites shows an empty list. I reproduced it twice, but the developer could not reproduce it with my steps.\n\n**Checked and working:**\n- **Sort:** Size, Size reversed, and Name ascending all order the files correctly. The Name order puts Indent2.md above Indent.md, which is how a collator orders names with the dot ignored, so I did not report it.\n- **Editor undo/redo:** typing, undo back to the original text (Save disabled again), and redo all behave correctly.\n- **View mode:** a GFM table in Notes.md renders as a table. Money.md (\"$5 and $10\") and Single.md render as plain text.\n- **Search and replace:** match count, regex search, replace all, undo of replace, and Match Case all work.\n- **Favourites:** favouriting and un-favouriting a file and a folder updates both the star and the Favourites list.\n\n**Not verified:**\n- The search/replace options (Aa, whole word, regex) sit beside the search field, not above it as the build note describes. I did not file this because the expected layout was ambiguous.\n\n**Test data state:**\n- Shopping.md and Notes.md: restored to their original text and saved.\n- Regex2.md: restored to \"cat@home dog@home\"; its file timestamp is unchanged.\n- Indent2.md: renamed back to its original name. Zeta: favourite removed.\n- Single.md: I removed the \"X\" in the editor, but the device connection dropped before I could save or verify it. It may be on disk as \"gamma\" or \"gammaX\". Please check it, and if needed open it and make the text \"gamma\" with no trailing newline.\n\nI have not signed off, because two of the areas still have unresolved bugs. The device connection needs to be restored to check Single.md and to retest the rename-favourite case if you want that confirmed."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 140, "cache_read_input_tokens": 504110, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 140}, "output_tokens": 7, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "b74f507e-9015-4e1d-b0e8-e77fb9fe6d9b", "uuid": "16cb55cd-aba9-4ad1-bcde-be11b60fa19a", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T01:12:58.533Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1w2NfsTtgZbJJVe2t4y"}
